{"3912030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gnomageddon: Forge of Infinity", "steam_appid": 3912030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "The Great Wars taught the gnomes a simple truth: survival belongs to those who know where the treasure is buried. Once master treasurekeepers, they now turn their skills toward treasure hunting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/8ff8c74154344388fe71a447e634ed02.poster.avif?t=1778087675\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/8ff8c74154344388fe71a447e634ed02.webm?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/8ff8c74154344388fe71a447e634ed02.mp4?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bring up to five friends and dig deep in search of the Forge of Infinity, a legendary lost artifact hidden far beneath a dangerous, ever-changing world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/9cfd826719d31ff6e6c436e7aa8c73c8.poster.avif?t=1778087675\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/9cfd826719d31ff6e6c436e7aa8c73c8.webm?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/9cfd826719d31ff6e6c436e7aa8c73c8.mp4?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gnomageddon is a physics-based action role playing game with a 10+ hour campaign. More difficult game modes with additional content are made available upon completing the campaign. The world is carefully procedurally created to make sure each playsession is fun and no two playsessions are the same! Gnomageddon supports campaign co-op with up to six players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/ab6b92baea5b100507731e2b9e8ac104.poster.avif?t=1778087675\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/ab6b92baea5b100507731e2b9e8ac104.webm?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/ab6b92baea5b100507731e2b9e8ac104.mp4?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each gnome under your command can be fully customized, including their skill trees and equipment. Use direct control for precision combat and switch to the strategic mode to define behaviors and issue orders to your crew.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/cf78aa0e6bd8ee45300516fa6d9777ee.poster.avif?t=1778087675\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/cf78aa0e6bd8ee45300516fa6d9777ee.webm?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/cf78aa0e6bd8ee45300516fa6d9777ee.mp4?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Discover hundreds of unique items and skills, each with meaningful gameplay impact. Most items can be modded, allowing you to craft your perfect build.", "about_the_game": "The Great Wars taught the gnomes a simple truth: survival belongs to those who know where the treasure is buried. Once master treasurekeepers, they now turn their skills toward treasure hunting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/8ff8c74154344388fe71a447e634ed02.poster.avif?t=1778087675\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/8ff8c74154344388fe71a447e634ed02.webm?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/8ff8c74154344388fe71a447e634ed02.mp4?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bring up to five friends and dig deep in search of the Forge of Infinity, a legendary lost artifact hidden far beneath a dangerous, ever-changing world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/9cfd826719d31ff6e6c436e7aa8c73c8.poster.avif?t=1778087675\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/9cfd826719d31ff6e6c436e7aa8c73c8.webm?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/9cfd826719d31ff6e6c436e7aa8c73c8.mp4?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gnomageddon is a physics-based action role playing game with a 10+ hour campaign. More difficult game modes with additional content are made available upon completing the campaign. The world is carefully procedurally created to make sure each playsession is fun and no two playsessions are the same! Gnomageddon supports campaign co-op with up to six players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/ab6b92baea5b100507731e2b9e8ac104.poster.avif?t=1778087675\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/ab6b92baea5b100507731e2b9e8ac104.webm?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/ab6b92baea5b100507731e2b9e8ac104.mp4?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each gnome under your command can be fully customized, including their skill trees and equipment. Use direct control for precision combat and switch to the strategic mode to define behaviors and issue orders to your crew.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/cf78aa0e6bd8ee45300516fa6d9777ee.poster.avif?t=1778087675\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/cf78aa0e6bd8ee45300516fa6d9777ee.webm?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/extras/cf78aa0e6bd8ee45300516fa6d9777ee.mp4?t=1778087675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Discover hundreds of unique items and skills, each with meaningful gameplay impact. Most items can be modded, allowing you to craft your perfect build.", "short_description": "Gnomageddon is a physics-based action RPG where you command a team of gnomes and dig deep in search of the Forge of Infinity. Explore a procedurally generated world and collect hundreds of modifiable items alone or with up to five friends.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912030/b68a97130c5abe47b62f047bdf777985